      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;welcome-to-hugo&#34;&gt;Welcome to Hugo!&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a sample post demonstrating basic Markdown formatting in Hugo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;why-choose-hugo&#34;&gt;Why Choose Hugo?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Blazing fast performance 🚀&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simple content management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible templating system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built-in shortcodes support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;basic-syntax-examples&#34;&gt;Basic Syntax Examples&lt;/h2&gt;
